<section class="space-y-6">
  <header class="space-y-2">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Pricing</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Last updated: <%= effectiveDate %></p>
  </header>

  <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Job Hunter is available in three usage modes. Only the hosted mode involves a payment to this service.</p>

  <section class="space-y-4">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <article class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">Buy credits</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Use the hosted service. You purchase a prepaid credit balance; credits are consumed as the service runs.</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-600">
          <li>Credits cover source API costs, AI scoring, deduplication, and email delivery costs.</li>
          <li>A 10% service fee applies on top of underlying provider costs.</li>
          <li>Applicable taxes are calculated and collected at checkout by Paddle.</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/welcome" class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white text-sm font-semibold transition-colors">Get started</a>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">Bring your own keys</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Use the app at no charge by connecting your own provider API keys.</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-600">
          <li>No credit purchase required.</li>
          <li>You are billed directly by your providers (OpenAI, Apify, etc.).</li>
          <li>No service fee from Job Hunter.</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/welcome" class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white text-sm font-semibold transition-colors">Get started</a>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">Self-hosted</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Run the open-source code from GitHub for personal, non-commercial use.</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-600">
          <li>No charge from this service.</li>
          <li>You manage your own infrastructure, security, and provider keys.</li>
          <li>Commercial use is not permitted under this mode.</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="https://github.com/girshovich/linkedin-job-hunter" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-900 text-white text-sm font-semibold transition-colors">View on GitHub</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-3">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Credits</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Credits are a prepaid usage balance tied to your account. They have no cash value, are non-transferable, and cannot be shared between accounts. Credits are consumed when provider costs are incurred — when a job run executes, AI scoring happens, or emails are sent — regardless of the quality of results.</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Cost varies by the number and type of job sources used, roles and locations scored, AI model selected, and volume of matching jobs on the market. First use over a longer period fetches more results than daily updates, so costs more.</p>

    <h3 class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 pt-1">Credit packages</h3>
    <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl divide-y divide-gray-100 bg-white overflow-hidden text-sm">
      <div class="flex items-center px-4 py-3">
        <span class="font-bold text-gray-900 w-28 shrink-0">2 credits</span>
        <span class="text-gray-400 w-8 shrink-0 text-center">=</span>
        <span class="font-bold text-gray-900 w-16 shrink-0 pr-4">$4</span>
        <span class="text-gray-700 flex-1">To start and try</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center px-4 py-3">
        <span class="font-bold text-gray-900 w-28 shrink-0">5 credits</span>
        <span class="text-gray-400 w-8 shrink-0 text-center">=</span>
        <span class="font-bold text-gray-900 w-16 shrink-0 pr-4">$8</span>
        <span class="text-gray-700 flex-1">~80% source coverage, a couple of roles across 3–5 countries</span>
        <span class="ml-4 shrink-0 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-medium">save $2</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center px-4 py-3">
        <span class="font-bold text-gray-900 w-28 shrink-0">10 credits</span>
        <span class="text-gray-400 w-8 shrink-0 text-center">=</span>
        <span class="font-bold text-gray-900 w-16 shrink-0 pr-4">$15</span>
        <span class="text-gray-700 flex-1">Every source, a couple of roles across 3–5 countries</span>
        <span class="ml-4 shrink-0 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-medium">save $5</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center px-4 py-3">
        <span class="font-bold text-gray-900 w-28 shrink-0">20 credits</span>
        <span class="text-gray-400 w-8 shrink-0 text-center">=</span>
        <span class="font-bold text-gray-900 w-16 shrink-0 pr-4">$29</span>
        <span class="text-gray-700 flex-1">Best value for power users</span>
        <span class="ml-4 shrink-0 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-medium">save $11</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Coverage estimates are indicative. Paddle adds local VAT at checkout. Price includes Paddle processing fee (5% + $0.50) and the Job Hunter service fee, inclusive of 20% VAT on pre-bought API tokens.</p>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Unused credits may be refunded under the Refund Policy, and are forfeited if your account is closed or terminated for cause.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Billing and payment</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Hosted credit purchases are processed by <strong>Paddle.com Market Limited</strong> ("Paddle"), which acts as the Merchant of Record. Your purchase contract is with Paddle, not with Mikhail Girshovich personally. Paddle handles checkout, payment processing, receipts, and the collection and remittance of applicable taxes including VAT.</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mt-1">Checkout takes place on Paddle's secure payment page. You do not enter card details into Job Hunter. Paddle's <a href="https://www.paddle.com/legal/buyer-terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-700 hover:underline">buyer terms</a> and <a href="https://www.paddle.com/legal/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-700 hover:underline">privacy policy</a> govern your transaction.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Availability</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Hosted credit purchasing is planned and not yet available. These terms will apply once the feature launches.</p>
  </section>
</section>
